{'symbol': 'J', 'date': '2023-01-12 07:35:00', 'title': 'INTUITIVE MACHINES TEAMS WITH JACOBS TO SUPPORT NASA JETS II CONTRACT', 'text': "HOUSTON--( BUSINESS WIRE )--INTUITIVE MACHINES, LLC (“INTUITIVE MACHINES” OR THE “COMPANY”), A LEADING SPACE EXPLORATION, INFRASTRUCTURE, AND SERVICES COMPANY, TODAY ANNOUNCED IT WILL WORK ALONGSIDE JACOBS SOLUTIONS INC. (“JACOBS”) (NYSE: J) TO SAFELY AND SUCCESSFULLY ACCOMPLISH THE GOALS AND CONTRACTUAL REQUIREMENTS WITHIN NASA'S JOHNSON SPACE CENTER ENGINEERING, TECHNOLOGY, AND SCIENCE (JETS) II CONTRACT."}